wiki_concept(grammar, linguistics, "system of rules that governs how a natural language is structured and used, as evidenced by its speakers or writers").

% linguistics / Language
% source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language
% revision: 1372927239; processed: 2026-09-03T11:01:38Z
wiki_concept(language, linguistics, "structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary").

% linguistics / Sentence (linguistics)
